{"ar":["إِنَّآ أَعْطَيْنَٰكَ ٱلْكَوْثَرَ","فَصَلِّ لِرَبِّكَ وَٱنْحَرْ","إِنَّ شَانِئَكَ هُوَ ٱلْأَبْتَرُ"],"fr":["Nous t’avons certes, accordé l’Abondance.","Accomplis la Ṣalāt pour ton Seigneur et sacrifie.","Celui qui te hait sera certes, sans postérité."],"ph":["Innā aʿṭaynākal-kawthar","Faṣalli lirabbika wanḥar","Inna shāniʾaka huwal-abtar"],"tj":[[],[20,21,0],[2,5,8,21,22,0,26,28,14]]}